      "title": "MCP identity",
      "items": [
        "每进程 session correlation ID；每请求 trace_id。",
        "注入 Bearer、X-Session-Id、X-Trace-Id、X-Agent-Id。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "错误与完整性",
      "items": [
        "SDK/MCP 尽量透传业务错误、retryable/category/structured_data。",
        "MCP envelope 保留 coverage_ratio 与 namespaces_failed。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "接入边界",
      "items": [
        "MCP 直接 HTTP，不经过 Python SDK。",
        "Skills 缺少 matching resource 时通过 SDK request loop HTTP fallback。"
